## Network Monitoring Commands

| Command  | Purpose                          |
|----------|----------------------------------|
| top      | Monitor CPU & processes          |
| nload    | Monitor bandwidth usage          |
| iftop    | Live network usage               |
| tcpdump  | Capture network packets          |

